  "description": "Dreams come and go, but this nightmare is here to stay. A-Reum keeps a note to keep track of her dreams and premonitions, which, to her horror, oftentimes become true. One day, she discovers a set of pages she doesn’t remember writing, and that’s when all hell breaks out in her school. Can she piece the broken parts of her dream together and survive the terror that lurks in the dark? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
